0101-0113 proposition prop:final-package-shape-convention [Final package-shape convention]
For the current presentation package there is a single source-level package shape. The primary article is submission_abstract.tex; the selected technical supplement is main.tex; the selected bounded theorem-obligation ledger is theorem_inventory.json; and the selected supplemental support surface is exact inclusion of review_bundle/ with the final digest record review_bundle/FINAL_DIGESTS_SHA256.md. No archive locator, DOI-bearing replacement, or alternate supplemental directory is part of the current package convention. Consequently every bundle-backed support claim in this source is accepted only under exact inclusion of that directory with matching final digests; without that external inclusion record it remains a local package-support claim.

