For the current presentation-only route, the primary artifact, long technical supplement, and review bundle have distinct review roles. The primary source submission_abstract.tex states the presentation claim, main.tex proves the long-form interface theorems and records the case tables, and review_bundle/ supplies the supplemental source snapshots, case snapshots, and machine-readable manifest rows. None of these roles converts the support bundle into a second primary submission or converts a primary-artifact claim into an uncited supplement claim.

