3291-3303 proposition prop:primary-supplement-interface-map [Primary--supplement interface map]
Every load-bearing claim made in the current primary artifact submission_abstract.tex is certified by an explicit supplement theorem, table row, or manifest row at a declared evidence level. The certification map is Table~tab:submission-interface-map, refined by Table~tab:primary-claim-inventory, and mirrored in the submission_interface_map field of review_bundle/REVIEW_BUNDLE_MANIFEST.json and the file review_bundle/submission_interface_map.json. Therefore a reviewer can check the short-paper publication-safety invariant against this supplement without inferring hidden claims from prose.

