The bundle-backed support claims of the current package may be used only under the external-record condition of Theorem~thm:upload-or-archive-instantiation-boundary. In particular, review_bundle/FINAL_DIGESTS_SHA256.md is a local byte-level packaging manifest and not, by itself, an upload receipt or an archive locator; no archive replacement branch is selected for this source package.

